ike a premium, editorial-quality screen rather than just a data table. The image would set the tone immediately, and the gradient fade keeps the transition smooth.\n\nWant me to build out any of these concepts? Or we could also generate a new image based on the one you shared (e.g., same mountain scene but with an oxygen/atmosphere visual treatment layered on top).",
